    "text": "Let G be a hyperbolic group which is virtually compact special in the sense\nof Haglund–Wise. Suppose that the set of second Betti numbers of the finite-index\nsubgroups of G is bounded. Must G be virtually either a free group or a surface\ngroup?                                                                   H. Wilton",
